{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Dusty Priest Cloak procs on heal over time effects (#13497)",
  "contract": [
    "#13497: Dusty Priest Cloak (proc dummies 303041, 312832, 316832, 320832) never procced. Every dummy carries",
    "Spell.dbc ProcFlags 0 and the world had no spell_proc row, so SpellMgr::LoadSpellProcs skipped it. Tooltip:",
    "\"Your heal over time effects\", tiers \"(10sec. internal cooldown)\". Flags 262144 (done periodic) for heals",
    "only. The dummies' second effect (a root, 303039/312833/316833/320833) is not in the tooltip; it is disabled",
    "(DisableEffectsMask 2) by the PR author's ruling. spell_proc_chance reads each loaded entry's chance, which",
    "equals the record's ProcChance, and spell_proc_cooldown_ms reads each loaded cooldown. aura_proc_rate",
    "replays the aura's native proc decision, including the roll, 40000 times on one synthetic event per check.",
    "It procs on a heal over time tick (Rejuvenation 774), at the record's chance; it never procs on a direct",
    "heal (Flash Heal 2061), a periodic Shadow tick (Shadow Word: Pain 589). Before the repair the chance and",
    "cooldown lookups fail with 'Spell has no proc entry' and every rate reads 0, so the discriminating checks",
    "fail instead of flaking."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 60000,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "caster",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 1,
      "level": 80,
      "allow_regeneration": false
    }
  ],
  "creatures": [
    {
      "id": "dummy",
      "owner": "caster",
      "entry": 36,
      "level": 80,
      "health": 1000000,
      "distance": 4
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
